// Active Directory Collection Consistent With SharpHound
// Detects the command-line shapes produced by SharpHound and equivalent collectors. Mass AD enumeration is the reconnaissance step that precedes nearly every modern domain compromise.
// techniques: T1087.002   severity: high   status: stable
// validate: Atomic Red Team T1087.002
//   SharpHound.exe -c All --zipfilename loot
// source: rules/discovery/bloodhound-sharphound-collection.yml  (GENERATED, do not edit by hand)
Event
| where ((CommandLine has_any (dynamic(["sharphound", "-c all", "--collectionmethod", "Invoke-BloodHound", "bloodhound.py"]))))
